{
    "_comment": "The Angler in his shack by the pond (always in the Village). First quest of the game: his Hook.",
    "partner": "angler",
    "start": [
        {
            "if": {
                "quest_done": "hook",
                "flag": "boss:candy"
            },
            "goto": "after_candy"
        },
        {
            "if": {
                "quest_done": "hook"
            },
            "goto": "after"
        },
        {
            "if": {
                "quest": "hook",
                "item": "Hook"
            },
            "goto": "returned"
        },
        {
            "if": {
                "quest": "hook"
            },
            "goto": "waiting"
        },
        "intro"
    ],
    "nodes": {
        "intro": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "angler",
                    "pose": "grumpy",
                    "text": "What. You're blockin' my light."
                },
                {
                    "who": "player",
                    "pose": "grumpy",
                    "text": "Sorry. I'm new here."
                },
                {
                    "who": "angler",
                    "pose": "grumpy",
                    "text": "New. Hmph. Everybody's new these days. Nobody stays long enough to get old."
                },
                {
                    "who": "angler",
                    "pose": "pointing",
                    "text": "Forty years I've fished this pond. Forty. And d'you know what I got to show for it?"
                },
                {
                    "who": "angler",
                    "pose": "angry",
                    "text": "Nothin'. 'Cause somebody took my Hook."
                },
                {
                    "who": "player",
                    "pose": "angry",
                    "text": "Somebody stole it?"
                },
                {
                    "who": "angler",
                    "pose": "angry",
                    "text": "\"Borrowed\". Three weeks ago. \"Just for a minute, old man.\" A minute. Ha."
                },
                {
                    "who": "angler",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "Can't remember who. My memory ain't what it used to be."
                },
                {
                    "who": "angler",
                    "pose": "grumpy",
                    "text": "But it's somebody in this village. Don't look at me like that. I'm old, not stupid."
                },
                {
                    "who": "angler",
                    "pose": "proud",
                    "text": "That Hook's the best in the land. No... no hat. No cap. That's what you young folks say, ain't it? No cap."
                },
                {
                    "who": "player",
                    "pose": "proud",
                    "text": "...Sure."
                },
                {
                    "who": "angler",
                    "pose": "proud",
                    "text": "Knew it. Still got it."
                },
                {
                    "who": "angler",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Bring it back and I'll make it worth your while. Go on, then. Shoo."
                }
            ],
            "do": {
                "quest": {
                    "start": "hook"
                }
            }
        },
        "waiting": {
            "random_line": true,
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "angler",
                    "pose": "grumpy",
                    "text": "Got my Hook? No? Then why're you standin' here."
                },
                {
                    "who": "angler",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Somebody in the village has it. Ask around. Use that young brain of yours."
                },
                {
                    "who": "angler",
                    "pose": "grumpy",
                    "text": "Fish don't wait. And neither do I. Well. I do. But I don't like it."
                }
            ]
        },
        "returned": {
            "do": {
                "take": "Hook",
                "give": "Shrooms",
                "gold_piles": 2,
                "quest": {
                    "finish": "hook"
                }
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "angler",
                    "pose": "surprised",
                    "text": "..."
                },
                {
                    "who": "angler",
                    "pose": "happy",
                    "text": "That's it. That's my Hook. Look at that rust. Beautiful."
                },
                {
                    "who": "player",
                    "pose": "happy",
                    "text": "It was in the village, like you said."
                },
                {
                    "who": "angler",
                    "pose": "proud",
                    "text": "'Course it was. Told you. Old, not stupid."
                },
                {
                    "who": "angler",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Here. Take these. Found 'em by the water. Don't eat 'em all at once, they ain't candy."
                },
                {
                    "who": "angler",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "And some coin for your trouble. You're alright, kid. Don't go tellin' anyone I said that."
                }
            ]
        },
        "after": {
            "random_line": true,
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "angler",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Biting good today. Somethin' big down there. Somethin' real big."
                },
                {
                    "who": "angler",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "Back in my day we didn't have monsters in the grass. We had... well. Also monsters. But smaller."
                },
                {
                    "who": "angler",
                    "pose": "grumpy",
                    "text": "You again. Hmph. Fine. Stand there if you want. Just don't scare the fish."
                }
            ]
        },
        "after_candy": {
            "random_line": true,
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "angler",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Heard you got past the sweet lands. Good. Never liked the smell. Like burnt sugar and lies."
                },
                {
                    "who": "angler",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "Once found a chest by the road, way back. Gold or wisdom, I had to pick. Took the gold. Always take the gold, kid."
                },
                {
                    "who": "angler",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "Pond's been quiet since you started wanderin' far. Fish know things. Fish always know things."
                },
                {
                    "who": "angler",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "There's a windmill somewhere out east. Pays out every week if you visit. Or I dreamt that. One of the two."
                }
            ]
        }
    }
}
